# --- build output ---------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under build/ is regenerated by build.bat, and the executable is
# linked straight to the repo root.
build/
ArenaFighter.exe

# MSVC leftovers, wherever they land
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp

# --- local state ----------------------------------------------------------
# Written next to the executable at runtime. Per-machine, not source.
settings.dat

# --- character skins ------------------------------------------------------
# Scanned at runtime for .glb/.gltf. Deliberately NEVER tracked: whatever you
# drop in here is somebody else's art, and this repository is public and MIT
# licensed -- committing a model would be redistributing it under a licence we
# have no right to grant. Non-commercial and personal use is a question between
# you and whoever made the file; publishing it is not. The game runs with this
# folder empty and falls back to the built-in fighter.
assets/

# --- private working notes ------------------------------------------------
# Internal aids, not part of the published project. They live in the working
# tree on purpose (CLAUDE.md is only picked up from the project root) but are
# deliberately untracked.
ARCHITECTURE.md
CLAUDE.md

# --- editor / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# NOTE: vendor/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The raylib headers and binaries
# are committed so that a fresh clone builds with no setup step. raylib is
# zlib-licensed, which permits redistribution; see vendor/*/LICENSE.
